<# Density-optimised variant for candidates with enough experience to overflow
   two pages.

   Tightening happens through margins and list spacing rather than font size.
   Below roughly 10pt, older resume parsers that fall back to OCR on embedded
   fonts start making character-level mistakes, and a misread digit silently
   corrupts exactly the metrics the XYZ formula exists to surface. 10pt is the
   floor. #>
<% extends "_base.tex.j2" %>

<% block fontsize %>10pt<% endblock %>
<% block margintop %>0.4in<% endblock %>
<% block marginbottom %>0.4in<% endblock %>
<% block marginleft %>0.5in<% endblock %>
<% block marginright %>0.5in<% endblock %>
<% block sectionspaceabove %>-4pt<% endblock %>
<% block sectionspacebelow %>-6pt<% endblock %>
<% block bulletindent %>0.15in<% endblock %>
<% block bullettopsep %>1pt<% endblock %>
<% block bulletitemsep %>0pt<% endblock %>
<% block bulletbottomsep %>-4pt<% endblock %>
